report = f"# Toothwise formed-thickness force response: external validation exposes contact-state gap\n\nA runnable simulation now propagates labelled real-arch geometry and published formed thickness into each activated tooth's force and its neighbouring teeth's signed forces and crown-centroid moments. Twelve arches, 164 teeth and 328 stimulus scenarios are exported. **Actual specimen force and biological-window membership remain UNKNOWN.** Published sensor measurements refute the uncalibrated anatomical ribbon's force transfer.\n\n| Quantity | Nominal information | Formed information | External sensor mean ± SD |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n"
